SUMMARY:Monthly Dharma Group (Saturdays) – Meditation
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nYou do not have to walk this path alone. 
 In fact\, this journey is that much more rich and enjoyable when traversed
  with others.\nGroups Openings\n\nFirst Saturday of each month – morning
 s at 10:30 am Eastern\nLed by Buddhist teacher Ronya Banks\, this group me
 ets once a month\, for an hour and a half.\n\nGroup Meeting Includes:\nGro
 up Discussion and Sharing\nInstruction on Dharma/Buddhist Principles\nGuid
 ed Meditation\nMeditation Instruction\nConnecting with Other Practitioners
 \nMost people on a spiritual journey find it supportive\, often even neces
 sary to get the regular support of a meditation teacher\, as well as the m
 utuality and connection with other meditation practitioners on this path.\
 n\nThis monthly group affords you with the opportunity to connect with a t
 eacher and other like-minded people\, wherein you will all boldly delve de
 eply into different ways of approaching your formal and informal mindfulne
 ss practices through the lens of the Buddhist teachings.\n\nPrice: By Dona
 tion (According to your affordability and arranged with teacher)\nIf inter
 ested\, inquire via email to Ronya Banks at info@ashevillemeditation.com
