SUMMARY:🔥🦁Lions Gate Portal Sound Healing Journey 🦁🔥
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**An annual astrological event that occur
 s when the Sun is in Leo (the sign represented by the lion) and the star S
 irius rises in the sky\, aligning with the Earth and Orion's Belt. This ev
 ent typically peaks on (8/8) and is believed to be a time of increased cos
 mic energy\, and spiritual awakening.**\n\n🦁**Lions Gate Portal Sound H
 ealing Journey-Manifest Your Dreams Here with active Prayer and Sound Heal
 ing**\n\n**What is Lions Gate Portal:** An annual astrological event that 
 occurs when the Sun is in Leo (the sign represented by the lion) and the s
 tar Sirius rises in the sky\, aligning with the Earth and Orion's Belt. Th
 is event typically peaks on August 8th (8/8) and is believed to be a time 
 of increased cosmic energy\, spiritual awakening\, transformation\, A time
  when the fixed Star Sirius rises\n**⭐Sirius Rising**: Sirius\, the brig
 htest star in the night sky\, becomes visible again after a period of bein
 g hidden by the Sun’s glare. In ancient Egypt\, this event was associate
 d with the flooding of the Nile and considered a time of rebirth and renew
 al.\n**8️⃣Numerology**: The date 8/8 is considered significant in nume
 rology\, where the number 8 represents balance\, infinite loops\, and the 
 manifestation of abundance and power.\n**↩️Energetic Gateway**: The al
 ignment is believed to open a powerful energetic gateway that enhances spi
 ritual insights\, personal growth\, and the ability to manifest intentions
 .\n\n**We will begin** by honoring this celestial event by setting our int
 entions for manifesting our wishes\, dreams\, and desires into a slow burn
 ing altar allowing our intentions to be blessed by the sun and fire\, then
  we prepare to somatically integrate our intentions into a somatic sound h
 ealing experience that will permeate your entire being\, Then\, Then a 44 
 minute sound journey begins with gongs\, crystal bowls\, chimes\, hand pan
 \, kalimba\, crystal triangles including many hand held healing instrument
 s that will be hovered over your body for personal alchemization. After th
 e journey lands\, we will share experiences and seal it with an offering t
 o the sun.\n\n**David Heiss** specializes in Self-Discovery using sound al
 chemy though blending unique sounds with instruments including many gongs\
 , crystal bowls\, and other abstract sounding pieces creating a abstract s
 ymphony of sound overtones to create a healing restorative experience. Bei
 ng an Evolutionary Astrologer\, he offers natal chart readings to assist i
 n your self-discovery process as he has used these divine arts in his own 
 healing process with results. He has been working with stars and sounds\, 
 AKA Gongs and Astrology since 2012. His intention is to create a space thr
 ough sound to help you realize more of who you are.\n**What do we do durin
 g a sound healing?** Just lay down or sit and meditate on the sounds. Let 
 them take you on a journey into your own being. A time to relax into yours
 elf. It's a right brain\, passive experience that lasts about 1 hour.\n\nC
 heck David's offerings and other events here: [www.Starsounds.love](http:/
 /www.Starsounds.love)\n\nDonations start at $33 Give what you can\, if you
  would like to attend and need special lower pricing\, Please reach out to
  David at [david@starsounds.love](mailto:david@starsounds.love) we will ac
 commodate\n\n**PRE-REGISTER HERE:** [Star Sounds](https://www.starsounds.l
 ove/event-details/lions-gate-portal-sound-healing-journey-2)\n\n**What to 
 bring bring** a pad or mat\, pillow\, water bottle\, and or anything to be
  comfortable. Optional\, something for the Alter.\n**🔥🦁See You here
 🦁🔥**
