SUMMARY:New Moon in Leo Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nOur sacred monthly portal to set and send
  out our dreams and goals into the universe. Meeting new moons in ceremony
 \, allow us to amplify this energy together in circle.\nJoin us every mont
 h at the soul sanctuary. Alessandra a trained priestess and ceremonialist 
 and Vi a longtime practicing witch\, create a safe space to celebrate the 
 new moon.\n\nTickets: $16\nCash\, venmo\, Cash app\, Card all accepted at 
 event
